    {
      "id": "2e23e693-3175-46e5-8303-bf352407e63a",
      "name": "Sticky Note 9cd0ffd6",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Kynetic CRM -> Twenty sync (one-way)\nRuns every 30 min. For each Client Account record in Twenty that has both \"seldonframeOrgId\" and \"seldonframeApiKey\" filled in, pulls that client's contacts and bookings from the SeldonFrame CRM API and upserts them into Twenty's End Customer / Client Job objects, matched by the seldonframeContactId / seldonframeBookingId fields.\n\nTo onboard a client once they have a real SeldonFrame workspace: open that workspace Settings -> Integrations, generate an API key, then fill in the org UUID + key on that client's Client Account record in Twenty. Nothing else to configure -- the next scheduled run picks it up automatically.\n\nCRM base URL is hardcoded in the two HTTP Request nodes (kynetic-ai-fawn.vercel.app) -- update both if the production domain changes."
      },
      "position": [
        720,
        480
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
